    "reviews": [
      {
        "name": "places/ChIJiYnFtHkBBDQRhTgXyN3h9H0/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2psM1dVZEVNVkpRZFRjell6bERZWEJUUjBSdWNuYxAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "3 個月前",
        "rating": 4,
        "text": {
          "text": "🍋 緣起Threads的檸檬撻之旅\n\n偶然在Threads滑到這間咖啡店，他們的檸檬撻深深吸引了我，早已在心裡默默計劃著要去一探究竟🍋。\n\n果然，這檸檬撻沒有讓我失望，暫時是我在咖啡店裡吃過的最佳檸檬撻之一✨。甜度不過分，酸味輕輕綻放，宛如夏日微風般清新。搭配一杯咖啡，恰到好處，完美平衡☕️。我那天點的拿鐵，入口順滑，風味層次分明，前中後的味道濃淡適宜。\n\n巧合的是，我坐對面時有人點了手沖咖啡，咖啡師推著手沖推車走到面前，細膩地展現整個沖泡過程。視覺、嗅覺與味覺在那一刻完美交融，像是一場360度的咖啡饗宴🎥☕️。期待下一次，有機會親自體驗他們的手沖咖啡，感受那份細膩與熱情。\n\nI happened to come across this café while scrolling through Threads, and their lemon tart immediately caught my eye. I had quietly planned to visit and try it for a while🍋.\n\nSure enough, the lemon tart did not disappoint. It’s one of the best lemon tarts I’ve had in any café so far✨. The sweetness was just right, and the tartness gently blossomed, like a refreshing summer breeze. Paired with a cup of coffee, it was perfectly balanced☕️. I ordered a latte that day; it was smooth on the palate, with distinct layers of flavor unfolding beautifully from start to finish.\n\nBy chance, someone at the table opposite me ordered a pour-over coffee. The barista rolled over a cart and carefully demonstrated the entire brewing process. In that moment, sight, smell, and taste perfectly merged into a 360-degree coffee experience 🎥☕️. I look forward to trying their pour-over coffee myself next time, to savor its delicate care and passion.",
          "languageCode": "zh-Hant"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "🍋 緣起Threads的檸檬撻之旅\n\n偶然在Threads滑到這間咖啡店，他們的檸檬撻深深吸引了我，早已在心裡默默計劃著要去一探究竟🍋。\n\n果然，這檸檬撻沒有讓我失望，暫時是我在咖啡店裡吃過的最佳檸檬撻之一✨。甜度不過分，酸味輕輕綻放，宛如夏日微風般清新。搭配一杯咖啡，恰到好處，完美平衡☕️。我那天點的拿鐵，入口順滑，風味層次分明，前中後的味道濃淡適宜。\n\n巧合的是，我坐對面時有人點了手沖咖啡，咖啡師推著手沖推車走到面前，細膩地展現整個沖泡過程。視覺、嗅覺與味覺在那一刻完美交融，像是一場360度的咖啡饗宴🎥☕️。期待下一次，有機會親自體驗他們的手沖咖啡，感受那份細膩與熱情。\n\nI happened to come across this café while scrolling through Threads, and their lemon tart immediately caught my eye. I had quietly planned to visit and try it for a while🍋.\n\nSure enough, the lemon tart did not disappoint. It’s one of the best lemon tarts I’ve had in any café so far✨. The sweetness was just right, and the tartness gently blossomed, like a refreshing summer breeze. Paired with a cup of coffee, it was perfectly balanced☕️. I ordered a latte that day; it was smooth on the palate, with distinct layers of flavor unfolding beautifully from start to finish.\n\nBy chance, someone at the table opposite me ordered a pour-over coffee. The barista rolled over a cart and carefully demonstrated the entire brewing process. In that moment, sight, smell, and taste perfectly merged into a 360-degree coffee experience 🎥☕️. I look forward to trying their pour-over coffee myself next time, to savor its delicate care and passion.",
          "languageCode": "zh-Hant"
        },
